  title: "From SYNOP to Station Model Symbols on Web Maps: Leveraging Web Technologies to Implement Standardized WMO Symbology for Synoptic Surface Weather Charts"
  doi: 10.3390/ijgi15040150
  url: https://www.mdpi.com/2220-9964/15/4/150
